WEBVTT

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:13.639
Lapping waves. The sea breeze.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:20.479
Blue and white in high contrast.

00:00:20.479 --> 00:00:22.648
And we have our guns.

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:26.068
It's the perfect summer resort.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:47.297
<i>School never taught me what friends are</i>

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:52.678
<i>People are such difficult creatures</i>

00:00:52.678 --> 00:00:57.099
<i>This world where you never</i>
<i>know what's said behind your back</i>

00:00:57.099 --> 00:01:02.646
<i>Looks a little ugly to me</i>

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:07.526
<i>Compassion and ego sway on the scales</i>

00:01:07.526 --> 00:01:12.072
<i>They've swayed ever since I met you</i>

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.992
<i>Your trespassing did a number on me</i>

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:19.288
<i>It's not like anyone would do</i>

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:19.538
<i>Is your empathy and complicity just an act?</i>

00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:20.706
"Kisaragi"
"Katasu - Yami"
<i>Is your empathy and complicity just an act?</i>

00:01:20.706 --> 00:01:24.793
<i>Is your empathy and complicity just an act?</i>

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:29.131
<i>Like a fish out of water</i>

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:31.425
<i>Delicacy and literacy</i>

00:01:31.425 --> 00:01:34.011
<i>Might not be necessary</i>

00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:37.181
<i>I just want to be wanted</i>

00:01:37.181 --> 00:01:39.600
<i>Selfish little me</i>

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:43.770
<i>The scales have tipped</i>

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.023
<i>As friends</i>

00:01:46.023 --> 00:01:52.029
<i>Let's meet in a secret place</i>

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:25.354
Why'd you do that?

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:28.357
Huh?! Where are we?

00:02:28.357 --> 00:02:32.194
It looks like a stylish... bungalow...
or maybe a cottage?

00:02:32.194 --> 00:02:35.072
What are we even doing here?

00:02:41.245 --> 00:02:43.914
When's checkout?

00:02:43.914 --> 00:02:46.041
Listen, Toriko...

00:02:55.676 --> 00:02:58.428
We ate and drank at the first place,

00:02:58.428 --> 00:03:03.141
did some bar hopping,
and then some shopping.

00:03:10.732 --> 00:03:13.694
Then we went back to our room and...

00:03:17.948 --> 00:03:22.828
I remembered to charge my phone.
I never miss a beat, even when drunk.

00:03:24.955 --> 00:03:26.540
What the...?

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:29.835
Hey, wake up. I brought you some coffee.

00:03:29.835 --> 00:03:31.837
I need coffee!

00:03:31.837 --> 00:03:35.465
That's why I brought it. It's already 10:30.

00:03:35.465 --> 00:03:37.551
C'mon, get up before--!

00:03:39.094 --> 00:03:41.555
W-Wait a second.

00:03:41.555 --> 00:03:47.728
Does this mean I shared a bed
with a naked woman all night?

00:03:47.728 --> 00:03:48.770
It's cold.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.397
Put some clothes on!

00:03:52.858 --> 00:03:54.985
Okay, let's get ready to go.

00:03:54.985 --> 00:03:56.486
Why are we leaving?

00:03:56.486 --> 00:03:59.448
Why wouldn't we? We've got school and stuff.

00:03:59.448 --> 00:04:03.493
Did you forget your promise?
You said we'd go to the beach.

00:04:03.493 --> 00:04:04.494
The beach?

00:04:04.494 --> 00:04:07.539
Yeah! We even bought swimsuits.

00:04:07.539 --> 00:04:10.083
Swimsuits? When was that?

00:04:11.084 --> 00:04:12.544
Last night.

00:04:14.713 --> 00:04:20.052
It's such a nice day, and we're here
at a beach resort in the summer!

00:04:20.052 --> 00:04:21.762
C'mon, Sorawo!

00:04:22.721 --> 00:04:24.890
Get dressed already.

00:05:10.435 --> 00:05:15.357
Sorawo. Sorawo, hey, wake up.

00:05:16.441 --> 00:05:18.527
Sorry, I fell asleep.

00:05:18.527 --> 00:05:21.238
We there already? How much for the taxi ride?

00:05:21.238 --> 00:05:24.908
Who knows? The driver's gone.

00:05:24.908 --> 00:05:28.078
Huh? What?!

00:05:30.038 --> 00:05:32.040
What's going on?

00:05:37.421 --> 00:05:41.175
It was like this when I woke up.
It makes no sense.

00:05:49.641 --> 00:05:52.352
Is this the Otherside?

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:54.396
Probably.

00:05:54.396 --> 00:05:56.982
Wow!

00:05:56.982 --> 00:05:58.942
See anything sketchy?

00:05:58.942 --> 00:06:01.361
The coast is clear so far.

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:03.238
Okay, then...

00:06:03.238 --> 00:06:05.866
W-Wait. What are you doing?

00:06:05.866 --> 00:06:11.205
Let's check it out. Whether it's our world
or the Otherside, we're at the beach!

00:06:11.205 --> 00:06:12.748
You're way too positive.

00:06:12.748 --> 00:06:16.627
It would totally suck to miss out on this.

00:06:16.627 --> 00:06:19.379
So let's go! We have our guns if we need them.

00:06:19.379 --> 00:06:20.631
B-But...

00:06:20.631 --> 00:06:24.593
We should enjoy the beach since we're here.
Don't be a scaredy-cat!

00:06:24.593 --> 00:06:27.596
Oh... um, okay.

00:06:33.519 --> 00:06:36.104
Oh, is that a beach shop?

00:06:36.104 --> 00:06:39.274
Let's have a look.
Maybe there's a changing room.

00:06:46.031 --> 00:06:47.491
I'll see if it's all clear.

00:06:47.491 --> 00:06:49.743
Wait. I'll go with you.

00:06:51.954 --> 00:06:53.956
I'm ready. Let's go.

00:06:53.956 --> 00:06:57.000
I'll watch ahead of us. You watch behind.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.460
Okay.

00:07:06.927 --> 00:07:10.764
How about opening the windows?
I'll keep an eye out.

00:07:10.764 --> 00:07:11.932
On it.

00:07:11.932 --> 00:07:15.352
Watch your step. There might
be nails or broken glass.

00:07:15.352 --> 00:07:17.312
Okay.

00:07:20.274 --> 00:07:22.442
The first floor's clear.

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:27.197
I'd like to check the second floor,
too, but I don't hear anything.

00:07:27.197 --> 00:07:30.117
This place looks abandoned.

00:07:30.117 --> 00:07:32.244
Forget it, then. Let's go!

00:07:32.244 --> 00:07:33.412
Okay.

00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:40.752
Oh, we could've changed in there.

00:07:40.752 --> 00:07:42.171
True.

00:07:42.171 --> 00:07:45.090
We wasted all that time searching that place.

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:47.801
It's always best to make sure
the coast is clear.

00:07:47.801 --> 00:07:49.928
Here's yours, Sorawo.

00:07:50.846 --> 00:07:53.515
Hey, what's the matter?

00:07:53.515 --> 00:07:58.187
It's just... I was in elementary school
the last time I wore a swimsuit in public.

00:07:58.187 --> 00:08:00.147
Honestly, I'm kind of embarrassed.

00:08:00.147 --> 00:08:03.108
You'll be fine. Besides, I'm here with you.

00:08:03.108 --> 00:08:05.861
Easy for you to say with that nice body.

00:08:05.861 --> 00:08:08.322
Hmm...

00:08:08.322 --> 00:08:14.953
Could it be you have a scar or tattoo
you're self-conscious about?

00:08:14.953 --> 00:08:17.372
If so, I'm sorry I was so insensitive.

00:08:17.372 --> 00:08:19.917
Oh, no, it's nothing like that.

00:08:19.917 --> 00:08:25.088
Oh, then you're good to go, Sorawo.
You've got nothing to worry about.

00:08:25.923 --> 00:08:28.884
Right? So let's go change.

00:08:34.932 --> 00:08:37.309
Why do I feel so uncomfortable?

00:08:37.309 --> 00:08:39.895
Oh, whatever.

00:08:39.895 --> 00:08:44.024
Oh! That looks great on you, Sorawo. It's cute!

00:08:44.024 --> 00:08:46.360
O-Oh, really?

00:08:47.861 --> 00:08:50.197
You look great, too, Toriko. Really pretty.

00:08:50.197 --> 00:08:52.741
Oh, thanks.

00:08:52.741 --> 00:08:55.369
L-Let's go.

00:08:55.369 --> 00:08:56.662
Sure.

00:09:11.343 --> 00:09:13.303
Look at the ocean.

00:09:14.596 --> 00:09:17.266
Hey, what do you think that is?

00:09:17.266 --> 00:09:19.476
It looks like Alcatraz.

00:09:19.476 --> 00:09:21.895
That's one massive prison.

00:09:21.895 --> 00:09:23.230
Wanna drink something?

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:26.608
Yeah, sounds good. Let's have a toast!

00:09:26.608 --> 00:09:28.569
--Yay!
--Cheers!

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:37.828
Skipping school to drink beer in Okinawa
makes it taste even better!

00:09:37.828 --> 00:09:40.038
How can I ever go back?

00:09:40.038 --> 00:09:41.957
You probably can't.

00:09:41.957 --> 00:09:45.460
I was thinking. What will we do
with our guns on the way back?

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.838
We can't take them on the plane.

00:09:47.838 --> 00:09:51.008
Could we take them apart
and send them home by courier?

00:09:51.008 --> 00:09:54.678
No way. I'm sure they x-ray the packages.

00:09:54.678 --> 00:09:57.097
How about going home via the Otherside?

00:09:57.097 --> 00:09:59.600
What? From here?

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:03.687
Hmm, I don't see any likely candidates.

00:10:03.687 --> 00:10:06.607
In that case...

00:10:06.607 --> 00:10:08.483
Wanna go down to the water?

00:10:08.483 --> 00:10:10.068
Sounds good.

00:10:12.154 --> 00:10:14.364
The sand's hot!

00:10:29.129 --> 00:10:30.672
Looks safe enough.

00:10:30.672 --> 00:10:32.132
Yay!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.350
Oh, that feels so good!

00:10:44.019 --> 00:10:47.856
I wonder how far this ocean goes.

00:10:47.856 --> 00:10:49.775
All the way to Nirai Kanai?

00:10:49.775 --> 00:10:51.068
What's that?

00:10:51.068 --> 00:10:53.779
It's like the Okinawan version of the afterlife.

00:10:53.779 --> 00:10:55.364
Oh...

00:10:55.364 --> 00:10:58.659
So that's the very edge of this world.

00:11:00.536 --> 00:11:04.456
I never thought I'd be able
to enjoy the beach like this.

00:11:04.456 --> 00:11:05.874
Why?

00:11:05.874 --> 00:11:10.128
It's like, I never really thought
of the beach as my kind of place.

00:11:10.128 --> 00:11:12.464
It seemed like a scary place
full of party people.

00:11:12.464 --> 00:11:16.927
Anyway, I'm glad you brought me here.

00:11:16.927 --> 00:11:18.387
I'm glad, too.

00:11:18.387 --> 00:11:24.685
You're always letting me have my way,
so I was worried you'd get sick of me.

00:11:24.685 --> 00:11:27.062
I'm so happy you're here with me.

00:11:27.062 --> 00:11:29.940
It's the first time I've been
to the beach with a friend.

00:11:32.568 --> 00:11:34.361
Listen...

00:11:34.361 --> 00:11:37.030
Now that I'm friends with you, Sorawo,

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:40.325
I wanna do all the things
that friends do together.

00:11:40.325 --> 00:11:43.245
But I feel like I'm being a little too pushy.

00:11:43.245 --> 00:11:45.455
So you do have some self-awareness.

00:11:45.455 --> 00:11:48.250
I've been a little pushy, huh?

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:53.839
Since we're here, let's do all
the things people do at the beach.

00:11:53.839 --> 00:11:57.426
Yeah! First up... let's drink!

00:11:57.426 --> 00:11:58.802
We already did.

00:11:58.802 --> 00:11:59.928
Barbeque!

00:11:59.928 --> 00:12:01.722
No equipment.

00:12:01.722 --> 00:12:03.390
Okay, then, beach volleyball!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:04.808
No ball.

00:12:04.808 --> 00:12:05.851
Play in the sand!

00:12:05.851 --> 00:12:07.519
We need shovels.

00:12:07.519 --> 00:12:08.770
Beach flags.

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:09.980
Sounds exhausting.

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:12.774
Ummm... Hit on people!

00:12:12.774 --> 00:12:13.817
Huh?

00:12:13.817 --> 00:12:17.821
Well, then, there isn't much to do, is there?

00:12:23.035 --> 00:12:24.578
What is it?

00:12:25.787 --> 00:12:28.498
Wanna practice shooting?

00:12:28.498 --> 00:12:30.375
Sounds good.

00:12:36.006 --> 00:12:38.175
Don't support it with just your arms.

00:12:38.175 --> 00:12:41.094
You gotta hold the stock
tight against your chest.

00:12:41.094 --> 00:12:44.348
That way, you'll absorb the recoil
with your entire body.

00:12:44.348 --> 00:12:49.144
Don't be scared. Just relax,
like you're embracing the rifle.

00:12:53.273 --> 00:12:54.149
Got it!

00:12:54.149 --> 00:12:55.192
Good!

00:12:55.192 --> 00:12:57.444
Yay!

00:12:57.444 --> 00:13:00.239
Now, my turn.

00:13:11.166 --> 00:13:13.418
That was amazing!

00:13:14.419 --> 00:13:18.257
I may be good now,
but I couldn't hit a thing at first.

00:13:18.257 --> 00:13:23.762
My mom taught me, but it
couldn't have been easy for her.

00:13:30.853 --> 00:13:33.647
Hm? What the heck's that?

00:13:33.647 --> 00:13:36.149
Something's floating beyond the target.

00:13:36.149 --> 00:13:38.527
Yeah, there's something there.

00:13:44.533 --> 00:13:47.369
What was that?

00:13:47.369 --> 00:13:49.746
That was weak!

00:13:50.831 --> 00:13:52.249
That way!

00:13:52.249 --> 00:13:53.542
What should we do?

00:13:53.542 --> 00:13:57.004
I don't know, but it sounds like trouble.

00:13:57.004 --> 00:13:59.089
Sorawo.

00:13:59.089 --> 00:14:00.507
Could you shoot someone?

00:14:00.507 --> 00:14:01.758
Huh?

00:14:05.929 --> 00:14:08.348
Stop it!

00:14:08.348 --> 00:14:11.059
Back away from him or I'll shoot!

00:14:12.561 --> 00:14:15.898
Good evening, Toriko Nishina.

00:14:15.898 --> 00:14:18.400
Hey, hey, who d'ya think you are?

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.736
What's up? You got a death wish?

00:14:20.736 --> 00:14:24.907
No, I think she's got balls.
You ain't scared of us, are ya?

00:14:24.907 --> 00:14:27.701
Whoa, dude's dead.

00:14:27.701 --> 00:14:30.120
Crap, now it's murder.

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:32.206
What a pussy.

00:14:32.206 --> 00:14:35.209
Next up... is her!

00:14:49.181 --> 00:14:51.099
I <i>can </i>shoot.

00:14:51.099 --> 00:14:53.185
Are you all right, Sorawo?

00:14:53.185 --> 00:14:54.186
Yeah.

00:14:54.186 --> 00:14:55.521
Really?

00:14:55.521 --> 00:14:58.148
Well, how can I put this?

00:14:58.148 --> 00:15:03.111
I guess I have no qualms about shooting
someone who's trying to destroy me.

00:15:03.111 --> 00:15:07.241
And I don't mean just physically,
but emotionally, too.

00:15:07.241 --> 00:15:11.453
Sorry. It really should've been
me who pulled the trigger.

00:15:11.453 --> 00:15:13.539
Sorry.

00:15:13.539 --> 00:15:15.999
You were ready to shoot, right?

00:15:15.999 --> 00:15:21.088
I knew you were totally serious,
which is why I was able to shoot.

00:15:21.088 --> 00:15:22.130
But...

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:24.550
Besides, they're not even human.

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:26.134
What?

00:15:26.134 --> 00:15:28.762
Something seemed off from the start.

00:15:28.762 --> 00:15:33.976
We'd been shooting for a while,
but it didn't seem like they noticed.

00:15:33.976 --> 00:15:37.479
And the things they were
saying were kinda weird.

00:15:37.479 --> 00:15:41.108
Oh... They just looked like humans to me.

00:15:41.108 --> 00:15:42.651
I'll do it real quick.

00:15:42.651 --> 00:15:45.279
The King of the Coast is coming!

00:15:45.279 --> 00:15:46.530
Jeez!

00:15:48.866 --> 00:15:51.034
That startled me.

00:15:51.034 --> 00:15:54.037
So then, those kids on the ground...

00:15:54.037 --> 00:15:55.330
They're not human either.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:56.790
Seriously?

00:15:56.790 --> 00:16:02.713
I should've gone over to see if they were okay.
What the hell am I doing?

00:16:19.396 --> 00:16:21.565
What will you do?

00:16:21.565 --> 00:16:24.067
I wonder what you should do.

00:16:26.069 --> 00:16:31.325
Did you know the midnight waters
off the coast are too bright?

00:16:32.743 --> 00:16:39.750
Do you think they'll notice?
I doubt it. It's an obscene story, but...

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:42.002
Sorawo, what is this?

00:16:42.002 --> 00:16:46.465
It's part of an internet urban legend.
The rest goes...

00:16:46.465 --> 00:16:49.635
You wouldn't know what I'm talking about.

00:16:49.635 --> 00:16:53.222
But when night comes,
Satsuki Uruma shinders to the shore, too.

00:16:53.222 --> 00:16:55.474
What will you do with Sorawo Kamikoshi?

00:16:55.474 --> 00:16:56.934
Satsuki?

00:16:56.934 --> 00:16:59.853
Toriko, do you remember
what you said a while back?

00:16:59.853 --> 00:17:00.604
Huh?

00:17:00.604 --> 00:17:04.107
The most dangerous moment
is when everything turns blue.

00:17:04.107 --> 00:17:07.361
...so scared that it drives us insane.

00:17:07.361 --> 00:17:10.364
They are so alien to us,
so utterly incomprehensible,

00:17:10.364 --> 00:17:14.368
that fear is the only channel
through which contact is possible.

00:17:14.368 --> 00:17:16.411
That's what you said.

00:17:16.411 --> 00:17:21.416
This is bad! Better brace yourself.
They're coming to drive us insane.

00:17:21.416 --> 00:17:23.752
They've clearly got their sights set on us.

00:17:23.752 --> 00:17:26.380
They know who we are!

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:31.301
I feel like I'm already going insane
just by remembering that time!

00:17:31.301 --> 00:17:34.096
The sea sparkle, squid, and flying fish

00:17:34.096 --> 00:17:37.099
make the midnight waters
off the coast really shine.

00:17:37.099 --> 00:17:42.187
It's amazing. It's like the starry sky.
Do you understand me?!

00:17:43.897 --> 00:17:48.735
Annn myooo jiii. Annnn myooo jiii.

00:17:48.735 --> 00:17:51.655
Annn myooo jiii.

00:17:53.699 --> 00:17:54.950
The stairs!

00:17:59.621 --> 00:18:02.583
Jyooo meee shinnn.

00:18:25.939 --> 00:18:27.691
Toriko, let's run.

00:18:27.691 --> 00:18:29.151
Where?

00:18:30.903 --> 00:18:33.030
To the beach umbrella. Run!

00:18:41.038 --> 00:18:43.832
Don't look at the shop! Do <i>not </i>look at it!

00:18:43.832 --> 00:18:46.585
I already did!

00:18:54.551 --> 00:18:56.720
Oh, right. I'm out of ammo.

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:59.681
Use mine. There should be some bullets left.

00:18:59.681 --> 00:19:00.974
What about you?

00:19:00.974 --> 00:19:04.228
I'm gonna get Lady Hasshaku's hat.
Keep watch until then.

00:19:04.228 --> 00:19:06.730
Okay. But first, check the ocean.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:07.898
Okay.

00:19:17.991 --> 00:19:19.785
That's beyond gross.

00:19:21.286 --> 00:19:22.788
We escape by putting it on?

00:19:22.788 --> 00:19:26.875
If we use it right,
I believe it can create a gate.

00:19:26.875 --> 00:19:30.212
Try holding the outer brim.

00:19:30.212 --> 00:19:31.213
Like this?

00:19:31.213 --> 00:19:33.423
Now move your hand just like I do.

00:19:33.423 --> 00:19:34.842
Is this okay?

00:19:34.842 --> 00:19:39.179
That's good. Focus on your fingertips,
and don't let go.

00:19:55.195 --> 00:19:57.781
Sorawo, the hat is--!

00:20:39.156 --> 00:20:40.991
We're alive.

00:20:40.991 --> 00:20:42.451
But where are we?

00:20:42.451 --> 00:20:44.286
I don't know.

00:20:51.502 --> 00:20:52.377
We made it.

00:20:52.377 --> 00:20:54.129
We sure did.

00:20:57.758 --> 00:21:00.219
Beer is sure good after a brush with death.

00:21:00.219 --> 00:21:01.428
Yeah.

00:21:01.428 --> 00:21:04.640
Lady Hasshaku's hat fell apart.

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:08.101
Now we can't sell it to Kozakura.

00:21:08.101 --> 00:21:12.606
Oh, that's too bad.
But it got us home in one piece.

00:21:12.606 --> 00:21:15.275
What are we gonna do? We're broke.

00:21:15.275 --> 00:21:18.111
Relax. It'll work out somehow.

00:21:18.111 --> 00:21:22.032
We'll go back to the Otherside
and find something else to sell.

00:21:22.032 --> 00:21:26.245
How can you say that after
such a terrifying experience?

00:21:28.038 --> 00:21:29.998
Whoa, it's so pretty.

00:21:29.998 --> 00:21:33.377
Careful. It looks like it's from the Otherside.

00:21:33.377 --> 00:21:37.965
Really? Then let's sell it to Kozakura.

00:21:37.965 --> 00:21:38.757
Huh?

00:21:38.757 --> 00:21:41.552
See? It worked out like I said.

00:21:47.850 --> 00:21:53.188
Right before the gate shut... I saw someone.

00:21:55.107 --> 00:21:56.608
It was...

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:02.072
"Resort Night at the World's Edge"

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:15.794
<i>My hair was tossed by the cold wind</i>

00:22:15.794 --> 00:22:19.923
<i>Did you notice me shut the window?</i>

00:22:19.923 --> 00:22:24.219
<i>I lose my nerve when we get so close</i>

00:22:24.219 --> 00:22:28.098
<i>I don't need something that won't last</i>

00:22:28.098 --> 00:22:30.225
<i>Flashbacks hurt</i>

00:22:30.225 --> 00:22:31.852
<i>Ever-lingering shadows</i>

00:22:31.852 --> 00:22:36.023
<i>I know I'm too bound by the past, aren't I?</i>

00:22:36.023 --> 00:22:38.442
<i>Hey, this feeling we felt</i>

00:22:38.442 --> 00:22:44.031
<i>There's no doubt about it,</i>
<i>it's got to be special</i>

00:22:44.031 --> 00:22:47.868
<i>You and me, crisscrossing emotions</i>

00:22:47.868 --> 00:22:52.080
<i>I don't want to look back with regret</i>

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:56.919
<i>I tell myself to believe</i>

00:22:56.919 --> 00:23:00.881
<i>And I tell my heart,</i>
<i>trust me, trust me, so sparkly</i>

00:23:00.881 --> 00:23:04.676
<i>It's the rhythm of a racing pulse</i>

00:23:04.676 --> 00:23:08.889
<i>As I gazed at your outstretched hand</i>

00:23:08.889 --> 00:23:15.020
<i>I decided I'd put my trust in you</i>

00:23:15.020 --> 00:23:23.487
<i>I will change myself, change myself</i>
<i>I will change myself, change myself</i>

00:23:23.487 --> 00:23:30.827
<i>I will change myself, change myself</i>
<i>I will</i>

00:23:32.663 --> 00:23:33.372
--Postmortem time.

00:23:33.372 --> 00:23:34.164
--Let's not.
--Postmortem time.

00:23:34.164 --> 00:23:35.832
There's so much we did wrong.

00:23:35.832 --> 00:23:39.628
No! The future is way more
important than the past.

00:23:39.628 --> 00:23:41.713
You're gonna be positive from now on!

00:23:41.713 --> 00:23:44.007
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

00:23:44.007 --> 00:23:47.136
Haven't you ever heard of positive thinking?!
